    U[URR motion targets]
    O[Vision-language orchestrator<br/>text memory, step check, recovery choice<br/>slower rate, exact rate undisclosed]
    P[Improved Dyna-2 action model<br/>approximately 5 Hz]
    W[RL whole-body controller<br/>100 Hz]
    R[Taku hardware and environment]
    S[Observed images and proprioception]
