    H -->|training data| U
    U -->|action supervision| P
    U -->|tracking targets in Isaac Lab| W
    O -->|control: current step| P
    P -->|control: URR trajectories| W
    W -->|control: joint targets and wheel velocities| R
    R -->|data: observations| S
    R -->|data: tactile sensing; consumer unknown| T
    S -->|data: visual progress| O
    S -->|data: observed context and body state| P
    R -->|data: body feedback; tensor schema unknown| W
  end
  subgraph Local[Owner: scene agent — local work]
    A[Implemented: official geometry and teleop-log conversion]
    V[Implemented: visual replay<br/>no dynamics, contacts or policy]
    C[Proposed: articulated Taku arm and free cloth<br/>frictional contacts and bounded actuators]
    F[Proposed: feedback diagnostic<br/>observe, grasp, lift, check, recover]
    E[Proposed: independent physical outcome evaluator]
    A -->|data: published kinematics and visual geometry| V
    A -.->|planned reuse; physics estimates separate| C
    F -.->|planned control: wrist and jaw targets| C
    C -.->|planned data: camera and proprioception| F
    C -.->|planned data: full contact and cloth state| E
  end
  Q[Owner: root<br/>review, CPU admission, result acceptance]
  Q -.->|control: admit only reviewed implementation| C
  E -.->|planned handoff: outcomes and full videos| Q
